  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.0:\n      - First official release of LuciferCore.Platforms.\n      - Decoupled application runtime suite from LuciferCore pure microkernel.\n      - Integrated Roslyn Source Generator for compile-time zero-allocation HTTP/WebSocket route generation.\n      - Out-of-the-box Middlewares: FirewallMiddleware, RateLimitMiddleware, and SessionMiddleware.\n      - Centralized runtime orchestration: LogManager, SimulationManager, and interactive CLI engine (LuciferCMD).",
